    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: ac3851e884fe197e1f201257131c58997051f942 -->\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nWhat looks good\n- The diff is one file, `crates/app/tests/pocket3d_hsm.rs`: only the Windows x86_64 arm of `bore_path_matches` (the triple and its comment) and a stale \"Windows remains its previously measured triple\" comment line in the macOS arm. No assertion elsewhere is loosened; the other arms and the fallback are untouched.\n- The pinned triple stays an exact equality, not a range.\n\nLocal results (trial merge with origin/main 5eeb0370e; already up to date, no conflicts)\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test pocket3d_hsm -- --ignored the_users_bore --nocapture` | 1 passed; printed `moves 16017 planar 15360 arcs 1427`, matching the new pin `(16017, 15360, 1427)` |\n| clippy / other suites | not run: test-only diff |\n\nRequested before merge: none.\n\nNotes (not blocking)\n- Test-only, so no process-file, dependency, changelog or PROCESS_VERSION implications.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
